                                           "y":  410,
                                           "content":  "Please accept this letter as formal application for the Full Stack Developer position at Antigravity, as advertised on your company website. With over five years of professional experience in software development and a Bachelor\u0027s degree in Software Engineering from NUST, I believe I am an excellent candidate for this role.",
