                                           "type":  "paragraph",
                                           "x":  100,
                                           "y":  530,
                                           "content":  "In my current position as Full Stack Developer at Antigravity, I have been responsible for designing and implementing scalable web applications using React, Next.js, and Node.js. I have successfully led multiple projects from conception to deployment, consistently meeting deadlines and exceeding performance targets. One notable achievement includes the development of a microservices architecture that improved system efficiency by 40%.",
                                           "style":  {
                                                         "fontSize":  14,
                                                         "fontWeight":  400,
                                                         "color":  "#374151",
                                                         "fontFamily":  "Georgia, serif",
                                                         "textAlign":  "left",
                                                         "lineHeight":  1.7,
                                                         "width":  "auto",
                                                         "height":  "auto",
                                                         "resize":  "both",
