                                           "type":  "paragraph",
                                           "x":  100,
                                           "y":  670,
                                           "content":  "Prior to my current role, I gained valuable experience working with various technologies including TypeScript, Python, PostgreSQL, and cloud platforms such as AWS and Vercel. My academic background in Software Engineering from NUST provided a strong foundation in computer science principles and software development methodologies.",
                                           "style":  {
                                                         "fontSize":  14,
                                                         "fontWeight":  400,
                                                         "color":  "#374151",
                                                         "fontFamily":  "Georgia, serif",
                                                         "textAlign":  "left",
                                                         "lineHeight":  1.7,
                                                         "width":  "auto",
                                                         "height":  "auto",
                                                         "resize":  "both",
                                                         "overflow":  "visible",
