                                           "type":  "paragraph",
                                           "x":  100,
                                           "y":  790,
                                           "content":  "I have long admired Antigravity\u0027s reputation for innovation and excellence in the technology sector. I am confident that my technical skills, combined with my strong work ethic and collaborative nature, would make me a valuable addition to your engineering team.",
